## Temporal Analysis

Signal variability was evaluated across pulses and frames.

The PMMA marker showed substantially greater temporal variation than the metal target. Metal produced a stable response across repeated acquisitions, whereas the twinkling signal showed irregular changes in amplitude.

For the IQ data, the RMS of the temporal standard deviation was:

- **PMMA twinkling marker:** 854.01
- **Metal:** 37.01

