## RF Spectral Analysis

The frequency spectrum of the beamformed RF signal was evaluated before and after wall filtering.

After wall filtering:

- Metal showed a relatively smooth and stable spectrum.
- PMMA retained greater residual spectral energy.
- The PMMA spectrum showed broader and more irregular frequency content.
- Strong spectral differences were observed near the transmitted frequency region.

Normalization was also used to reduce differences caused by overall signal magnitude and emphasize differences in spectral distribution.

