## IQ Spectral Analysis

IQ demodulation shifted the RF spectral content toward baseband.

The IQ spectra preserved the difference between the twinkling and non-twinkling targets:

- Metal retained a more stable spectral response.
- PMMA showed greater spectral variation and broader frequency content.
- Increased spectral variability remained visible after demodulation and wall filtering.

The RF and IQ analyses therefore provide complementary views of the same twinkling-related signal behavior.

